---
title: Titles & text
description: Ten ways to set a title, and how one arrives — line by line, letter by letter, typed, tracked, resolved out of pixels, scrambled, rolled. The style is a modifier; the arrival is the layer system.
eyebrow: Content creation · Elements
source: src/studio/title.css · src/studio/motion.css
---
<p><code>im-studio-title</code> is the display face: big, tight, one word in the accent. A style is a modifier on it, one idea each. A title never animates by itself — it is a layer like anything else, and <code>data-in</code> says how it arrives.</p>

